spec.text:
{
  "id": "T-301",
  "milestone": "M2",
  "depends_on": [
    "T-300"
  ],
  "title": "A dispatch or repin card shows its task spec's intent, done lines and flow chart taken from the spec itself, so firstmate cannot leave them out or change them",
  "public_title": "Build dispatch and repin cards from the task spec",
  "scope": [
    "bin/fm-decide.sh",
    "bin/lib/**",
    "tests/**",
    "design/design.md",
    "design/tasks/T-301.json"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "Why. A dispatch or repin card asks the captain to approve a task spec, but firstmate copies the spec's explanation into the card by hand. The spec check requires the flow chart; the card check does not. On 2026-10-12 the T-300 dispatch card went to the captain without its flow chart and had to be raised again.",
    "What. When firstmate raises a dispatch or repin card for a task, the card's intent, why, scope in and out, done lines, notes and before and after flow come from that task's spec explanation (the spec being approved), in both languages. Firstmate writes only the fields a spec does not have: the title, the explanation, before and after sentences, the outcome, the options and the questions. A card whose own copy of a spec field differs from the spec is refused with the field named. The check runs on the card the captain sees: a dispatch or repin card without the flow chart, the intent or the done lines is refused, whoever builds it.",
    "What, unchanged. Merge cards and other cards are built as today. A task with no spec explanation still cannot be dispatched.",
    "Done, tests. A dispatch card raised without the spec fields shows the spec's intent, done lines and flow in both languages (`card: dispatch takes spec fields`, fail-first); the same holds for a repin card and its new spec (`card: repin takes spec fields`, fail-first); a card that supplies a different flow is refused naming the field (`card: differing spec field refused`, fail-first); merge cards are unchanged (`card: merge unchanged`).",
    "Docs. The design section that describes dispatch and repin cards says the spec fields come from the spec."
  ],
  "explain": {
    "en": {
      "intent": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "A dispatch or repin card shows the spec fields as the spec states them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "A card that differs from its spec is refused."
        }
      ],
      "why": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Firstmate copied the spec by hand, and the T-300 card lost its flow chart."
        }
      ],
      "scope_in": [
        "dispatch cards",
        "repin cards",
        "tests"
      ],
      "scope_out": [
        "merge cards"
      ],
      "done": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 1: a test shows a dispatch card takes the spec flow."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 2: a test shows a differing card is refused."
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "T-301 waits for T-300, because both change the same helper files."
        }
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Write the spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "gone",
          "label": "Copy the spec by hand"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Raise the card"
        }
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Write the spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "new",
          "label": "Card reads the spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Raise the card"
        }
      ]
    },
    "zh-TW": {
      "intent": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "派工卡和 repin 卡照 spec 原樣顯示 spec 的欄位。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "系統拒收和 spec 不一致的卡片。"
        }
      ],
      "why": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "firstmate 手抄 spec，T-300 的卡片漏了流程圖。"
        }
      ],
      "scope_in": [
        "派工卡",
        "repin 卡",
        "測試"
      ],
      "scope_out": [
        "合併卡"
      ],
      "done": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 1：測試證明派工卡帶出 spec 的流程圖。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 2：測試證明系統拒收不一致的卡片。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "T-301 等 T-300，因為兩者改同一批輔助檔案。"
        }
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "寫 spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "gone",
          "label": "手抄 spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "送出卡片"
        }
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "寫 spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "new",
          "label": "卡片讀 spec"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "送出卡片"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
